          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, you may use this ability, once per battle per unit and once per battle round per army, while the triggering unit is within 8" of this model:
