      <profiles>
        <profile name="Goliath Truck" id="462a-da88-e71b-8b0f" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">12"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">Hull</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="e093-dd89-9cf3-b342" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fire Support" id="f86c-b8a1-5b6c-e22a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit this phase (your Fire Support Target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, if the attacking unit disembarked from this Transport this turn, you can re-roll the Wound roll for attacks made by all friendly models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="7e2a-5a12-5404-c2df" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
