      <profiles>
        <profile name="Crossfire" id="dc17-2966-3410-a7d5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, once per turn per unit, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence (your Crossfire Target). Until the end of the turn, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1 if it is made by a friendly GENESTEALER CULTS unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="0c69-38dd-b88d-8c3a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="526a-a0b3-f967-59fb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
