        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="9b6b-0145-b8cb-2059" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="fb7e-a7fb-3a30-a90e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Regenerating Gene-mass" id="439c-0e40-a65f-b5c4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if this model was destroyed this phase (1+ times), the first time this battle per model:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, this model can be set up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, with its full wounds remaining.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The Chosen One" id="0e63-deda-2613-7203" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a model in the unit is destroyed, while this model is leading a unit, while making melee attacks, unless the triggering unit has fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 4+, leave that model on the battlefield; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, it can fight. Remove it after it has fought.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="6744-cfa3-3815-4de4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
