        <profile name="Cloaked Assassin" id="00ad-92d6-5b43-c0c1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Your opponent cannot target the unit with Overwatch.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Creeping Shadow" id="e026-0a45-c925-a7ae" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a move, you may use this ability, if this model is equipped with one weapon named "Cult sniper rifle", during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of the unit, while the unit is unengaged, the unit can make a Normal move of up to 6".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Spoor" id="843f-523b-732d-7e64" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the start of the battle round, if during the first battle round:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit, binding it as prey selection (your Prey target). For the rest of the battle, each time this model makes an attack against it, while the target is a prey, you can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by this model; you can re-roll the Wound roll for attacks made by this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="3b0c-1b76-91be-4829" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Infiltrators" id="3f15-7262-2745-9b22" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Infiltrators ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lone Operative" id="0641-d4cb-d5ec-02d9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Enemy units cannot target this model with ranged weapons unless the attacking unit is within 12".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="63f3-f9c7-b213-9641" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
