        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="8c8a-a430-94e1-f3e6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Master Outrider" id="7193-946a-8d5c-aac6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is unengaged, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can make a Normal move of up to 6" as if it were your Movement phase.
  -&gt; The triggering unit cannot declare a charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Priority Target" id="fd21-b273-75c2-9552" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by cult sniper rifle during its just-finished shooting sequence (your Priority Target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 for attacks made by all friendly GENESTEALER CULTS models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stealth" id="905b-213b-74e7-ba34" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Stealth ability, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="668c-9901-a901-cc31" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
