        <profile name="Grinding Line-breaker" id="31b0-49d7-5604-ff5e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit starts a Fall Back move (the triggering unit must not have MONSTER or VEHICLE), while the triggering unit is within Engagement Range of this model:
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test, applying -1 to that test.
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is not Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="3a74-246e-cdca-2762" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="efb6-791c-3a19-c2ea" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="f343-f3a5-f3a6-bbb1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
