        <profile name="Leader" id="4643-4ca5-fc65-de93" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mind Control (Psychic)" id="5fee-a4a3-461c-ec0e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Shooting phase, you may use this ability, once per turn per army, if this model has the PSYKER keyword, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit is within 18" of this model:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
      - On 1: This model suffers D3 mortal wounds.
      - On 2-5: That unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.
      - On 6: That unit gets -1 to Hit rolls; that unit gets -1 to Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Spiritual Leader" id="08e7-9880-c60c-ca8a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of each phase, you may use this ability, once per battle per unit:
  -&gt; Select one friendly GENESTEALER CULTS unit if the selected unit is Battle-shocked and the selected unit is within 12" of this model: that unit is no longer Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="7ed7-d7ce-a01d-5053" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Familiar" id="ee84-b06e-324e-c71a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Shooting phase, you may use this ability, once per battle per unit, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; This model resolves the Psychic Familiar ability now.
  -&gt; Increase the range of this model's Mind Control ability by 6".</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
