                  <description>-&gt; At the end of your opponent's Fight phase: friendly PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS units that are unengaged can be placed into Strategic Reserves.
You cannot select this Detachment together with another PURESTRAIN Detachment.</description>
                </rule>
