              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Shooting phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by cult sniper rifle during its just-finished shooting sequence: that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
